<title>USA: ABC Bancorp sets 5-for-4 stock split.</title>
<headline>ABC Bancorp sets 5-for-4 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>MOULTRIE, Ga. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABC Bancorp said on Thursday that its board has approved a five-for-four stock split effective as of April 15, 1997.</p>
<p>Shareholders will receive one additional share for every four shares held on or about April 30, 1997, the company said.</p>
<p>The stock split will increase the number of outstanding shares of common stock to 6.7 milion from 5.4 million, ABC Bancorp said.</p>
<p>The company said it does not anticipate a reduction in its quartrly dividend of $0.10 a share.</p>
</text>
